#: ../../source/docs/common-alphaunmannedsystems-vcs.rst:5
#: 26e1d5f13f464108abd6e5c8998fa9d9 8131a384e6e74713ad194af7349a3542
#: cfc37f81d01d489ca24dbdec54dd5a82
msgid "Alpha Unmanned Systems Vessel Control Station (VCS)"
msgstr "Alpha Unmanned Systems 船载控制站（VCS）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-alphaunmannedsystems-vcs.rst:7
#: 032fa5e59c32482b9dbbddceb687f385 b4312bcf08a346c3a0b70b3dc7020b23
#: e4a0ba4e218b4593941ed833aa4086c1
msgid ""
"Alpha Unmanned Systems supports the **Vessel-Based Control Station (VCS)** "
"for tracking any device compatible with the MAVLink V1 or V2 protocol."
msgstr ""
"Alpha Unmanned Systems 支持 **船载控制站（VCS，Vessel-Based Control "
"Station）**，可跟踪任何兼容 MAVLink V1 或 V2 协议的设备。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-alphaunmannedsystems-vcs.rst:14
#: 105843c939b041d0ac17a9ddbb6b84af 37047fa6a6b94fa9ba04fd167c3f06b3
#: 5b377198030a4748b87972d763f99f0a
msgid ""
"The gyrostabilized mobile tracking antenna includes **four Ethernet ports**:"
" one port for connecting to the radio link, and three ports for connecting "
"the GNSS, joystick, and PC. The system tracks automatically the target when "
"a GPS position from the UAV is received through the radio links and the "
"local position received by the installed GNSS. Radio links are redundant and"
" selected automatically by the system or by the user."
msgstr ""
"这套陀螺稳定的移动跟踪天线包含 **四个以太网端口**：一个端口用于连接无线链路，另外三个端口用于连接 GNSS、操纵杆和 "
"PC。当通过无线链路收到无人机的 GPS 位置，并由安装的 GNSS "
"获得本地位置时，系统会自动跟踪目标。无线链路为冗余配置，由系统自动选择或由用户手动选择。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-alphaunmannedsystems-vcs.rst:17
#: 01c53dc432d3425d88c789be33928ad7 2682d396af6446d8a66a9a4627fa60f6
#: ef2a94892b1b490ca4b7d92e88275514
msgid "System Pack"
msgstr "系统套装"

#: ../../source/docs/common-alphaunmannedsystems-vcs.rst:19
#: 79ce6cd8cf184c9da19635989916f5fb a33f1d8617c84cbca1abde91dd6192c4
#: d2f83f05989c4cc69478a7bc8b1abe0b
msgid ""
"`Vessel-based Tracking Station "
"<https://alphaunmannedsystems.com/product/vessel-based-control-station/>`__."
msgstr ""
"`船载跟踪站 <https://alphaunmannedsystems.com/product/vessel-based-control-"
"station/>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-alphaunmannedsystems-vcs.rst:20
#: 50e2538fbfc74ff08e0f3a4b20f3c100 66dff4ad95064cfb9ff8aaaef7c183ee
#: e34d4de985974373a28ee1dbf8ea1a1b
msgid "**AC power cable** with **24V external supply connector**."
msgstr "带 **24V 外部供电接头** 的 **交流电源线**。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-alphaunmannedsystems-vcs.rst:21
#: 4276060c9fa546c88cf8ecb373abfde6 bb442d25c3d2461aaca2b7e164ef71b1
#: e574a6f315be4415a33e5eedd5ef773f
msgid "3x **IP67 Ethernet cables**."
msgstr "3 条 **IP67 以太网线**。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-alphaunmannedsystems-vcs.rst:22
#: f371c5ecffe148239331b6fc694b48cd f9bb1f1d52254580994febcd5381910a
#: fbac6e1dbf6044a7b89380c6705f9ead
msgid "**Mission Planner Plugin**."
msgstr "**Mission Planner 插件**。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-alphaunmannedsystems-vcs.rst:25
#: 70fdf92e69a4424e97495161cc3fa406 7b6ad54521484314ae53666a8c09c377
#: badbbe5e0f1a430b88ec34fe6bdb385b
msgid "System Setup"
msgstr "系统设置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-alphaunmannedsystems-vcs.rst:27
#: 18672f305ce44882930f0d5339eceaa9 7764606daafa41ab9acb38ecd2e3e6e6
#: 9d3706f283d04f10bf600c20b029cc45
msgid ""
"The **VTA** (Vessel-based Tracking Antenna) is the main system of a Mobile "
"or Vessel-based Control Station, but to be fully operational, it must be "
"coupled with the following systems:"
msgstr ""
"**VTA** （Vessel-based Tracking "
"Antenna，船载跟踪天线）是移动或船载控制站的主系统，但要完全投入运行，必须与以下系统配合使用："

#: ../../source/docs/common-alphaunmannedsystems-vcs.rst:29
#: 6773d28ffc5d4afc897179d92546fb04 ea9d2915a5c241048771d6ce1f95bd2a
#: ef80e56eeea84004bbbf5273f24bf93a
msgid "UAV Operator laptop (or fixed PC)"
msgstr "无人机操作员笔记本电脑（或固定 PC）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-alphaunmannedsystems-vcs.rst:30
#: 6364aeb184d44cf4978727ca699cd0fe afc222131a834493a7eb2f52c3bf0ec5
#: e6a8bd3c7bab4721a4e3777ab3faf168
msgid "Payload operator laptop (or fixed PC)"
msgstr "载荷操作员笔记本电脑（或固定 PC）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-alphaunmannedsystems-vcs.rst:31
#: 353c08d61eca4333a978f7beec7fdd96 9505a6ffd91446b4b5ab815d6a257e55
#: eb1bb75d765b4d7291f182e41f32ff9f
msgid "Joystick Ethernet"
msgstr "以太网操纵杆"

#: ../../source/docs/common-alphaunmannedsystems-vcs.rst:32
#: 0d9b0401ddca4a51bc0071af47ce21f0 7d5a60f1d4ff42e3b6c44935fe4f256b
#: b644ca0e8c474e90a450a7e185c0bf49
msgid "AC/DC power supply"
msgstr "AC/DC 电源"

#: ../../source/docs/common-alphaunmannedsystems-vcs.rst:33
#: 8ac3058e32a646adafb2924f5836143c 9f20de8ec9e64f79a68710c3e2e2b43c
#: aa72a6df39be4ddba784debce1a36ed1
msgid "Optional backup battery (output voltage must be below 24V: 18-23V)"
msgstr "可选备用电池（输出电压必须低于 24V：18-23V）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-alphaunmannedsystems-vcs.rst:41
#: 57828f026c894ac09e7a63140edf60b2 a56145d396a44ff2855f80c828189c78
#: ac804b4f69ce4710901b8fb5e6653418
msgid "Connection Diagram"
msgstr "连接示意图"

#: ../../source/docs/common-alphaunmannedsystems-vcs.rst:43
#: 041b3a11835242229cee647e18e06ca2 7a5771508f284192831fdb5a7d56e775
#: b269ce3c4361468f92d7df78b2af45e7
msgid ""
"The system is composed of 4 ETH connectors available for the connection of "
"external systems. They are:"
msgstr "系统提供 4 个可用于连接外部系统的 ETH 接口，分别为："

#: ../../source/docs/common-alphaunmannedsystems-vcs.rst:45
#: 19e46241ba2543ef908b4344a0549c62 3ced540563644a8f8b835591055f64c6
#: f993cfd5af4d43c98b29904ab0c523b0
msgid ""
"**ETH 0 – VIDEO:** This is the only ETH port for payload connection. It is "
"not connected to the ETH Switch, but directly to the data link. Normally, "
"this port would be connected to the payload control laptop or PC. This port "
"does not have POE (Power Over Ethernet)."
msgstr ""
"**ETH 0 – VIDEO：** 这是唯一用于连接载荷的 ETH 端口。它不接 ETH "
"交换机，而是直接连到数据链路。通常该端口连接载荷控制笔记本电脑或 PC。该端口不带 POE（以太网供电）。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-alphaunmannedsystems-vcs.rst:46
#: 68b8e734398f4459b8a2fb3866b54c4e cf365b734e2b4cb191d8a8a94c1715de
#: f026438547b44114b976a4c5f54759f9
msgid ""
"**ETH 2 & 4 – CS/JY:** Port for the connection of the control station laptop"
" or UAV control Joystick. This port does have POE."
msgstr "**ETH 2 & 4 – CS/JY：** 用于连接控制站笔记本电脑或无人机控制操纵杆的端口。该端口带有 POE。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-alphaunmannedsystems-vcs.rst:47
#: 27edb282896546c19b319c9f08ed7493 38369c8eee3e48798b209ff3d2587639
#: fe322816ca5c415abffc9c3ef8a9e1db
msgid ""
"**ETH 5 – IMU & GNSSCOMPASS:** This port is reserved for the connection of "
"the IMU & GNSSCOMPASS module. This port does have POE."
msgstr ""
"**ETH 5 – IMU & GNSSCOMPASS：** 该端口预留用于连接 IMU 和 GNSSCOMPASS 模块。该端口带有 POE。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-alphaunmannedsystems-vcs.rst:55
#: 082583e1105849a1b811d7362bd4ddf4 3872b7f3f26644a085f6b577ce1bab95
#: e57fb72e81bc4fcaafbf84dbddea2b28
msgid "Data Link Interface"
msgstr "数据链路接口"

#: ../../source/docs/common-alphaunmannedsystems-vcs.rst:57
#: 4805c27a9abf4e1194381d08c7353a16 71338129e0934a1581a988870bab9eb3
#: 95061d2d429847578c61e6199a1bf2c8
msgid ""
"The system has available two redundant datalinks which once configured can "
"connect automatically to the airborne datalinks, using one at a time."
msgstr "系统提供两条冗余数据链路，配置完成后可自动连接机载数据链路，同一时间使用其中一条。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-alphaunmannedsystems-vcs.rst:59
#: a9eb78b7d11944dca1fc84aee58aa917 b61bec9f4d0a439eb6fc197c5c21fe96
#: d37563a87a904624b20f86d57e808362
msgid ""
"One datalink of 900MHz is placed internally into the VTA and transfers only "
"telemetry information to the tracking system, while the other datalink of a "
"wide range of available frequencies (2.4-5.8 GHz) is externally placed into "
"the Pan Tilt Unit (PTU) and transfers telemetry information and video "
"through the external port."
msgstr ""
"一条 900MHz 数据链路置于 VTA 内部，只向跟踪系统传输数传信息；另一条数据链路可用频率范围较宽（2.4-5.8 "
"GHz），外置于俯仰回转单元（PTU，Pan Tilt Unit）上，通过外部端口传输数传信息和视频。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-alphaunmannedsystems-vcs.rst:61
#: 48e4b206ca1c4f8f9330d5fc1afbb7e5 a46d46c852fd4598be000fbec64a45db
#: da9a5bbd866f47f3835bb3652f229395
msgid ""
"The following diagram shows the pinout of the PTU used to connect and power "
"data links. This is to be used only for custom data link integrations."
msgstr "下图展示了 PTU 上用于连接数据链路并为其供电的引脚定义。仅供自定义数据链路集成时使用。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-alphaunmannedsystems-vcs.rst:74
#: 4fa3f54c629742baa3faba71c1d6a894 7a946defa4924ab2928cfb51330969f6
#: c41a680723b248c4bdbb9250fa8f1a59
msgid ""
"Telemetry is transferred through serial interface to the internal tracking "
"controller, which selects automatically the active link and transfers the "
"information to the PC through the HUB port."
msgstr "数传通过串口传输到内部跟踪控制器，控制器自动选择当前使用的链路，并通过 HUB 端口将信息传输到 PC。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-alphaunmannedsystems-vcs.rst:77
#: 2bf55a9e2d7546f38b8839a71c7c39e1 8f7d686fdf5744f9ba6c850ad9fce847
#: b953a1d4cec246708ed768afe9871711
msgid "Data output"
msgstr "数据输出"

#: ../../source/docs/common-alphaunmannedsystems-vcs.rst:79
#: 382358843f5347d3a01ee9e80eb40471 e4a352fb5f4842348416d5c5aea01d16
#: f66686eab0d64887b640fcf5fd23abfb
msgid ""
"The VTA main processing unit has its own proprietary ICD to feed other "
"systems (C2 or UAV ground control software) with its status information. "
"This information can be streamed in parallel with other streams like NMEA "
"0183/NMEA 2000 output or the GNSS and compass IMU information."
msgstr ""
"VTA 主处理单元有自己专有的 ICD，用于向其他系统（C2 或无人机地面控制软件）提供其状态信息。该信息可与其他数据流并行输出，例如 NMEA "
"0183/NMEA 2000 输出，或 GNSS 与罗盘 IMU 信息。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-alphaunmannedsystems-vcs.rst:83
#: 18bf8f04f35944eb9890bfebda3ff75a 6d3396d9e6e043b183e3f191f72bf603
#: a2e03d6ac4b24278a604af979d63c3d1
msgid ""
"More information about the specific communications protocol (ICD) can be "
"requested from `Alpha Unmanned Systems "
"<https://alphaunmannedsystems.com/contact/>`__."
msgstr ""
"有关具体通信协议（ICD）的更多信息，可向 `Alpha Unmanned Systems "
"<https://alphaunmannedsystems.com/contact/>`__ 索取。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-alphaunmannedsystems-vcs.rst:86
#: 1679c3676d784d48b251d8cab197fbf4 2051b7a83ffa44e19d81e5b1d6193e39
#: fd123d03880d4eef9f5dfb79b886c5b8
msgid "VCS Installation and integration on vessels"
msgstr "VCS 在船上的安装与集成"

#: ../../source/docs/common-alphaunmannedsystems-vcs.rst:88
#: 590ce44fc4554ca8aab9eb702f7e8ddf 90ce2abd78f44f568b752e85e49e7e24
#: 93cb6a890d074c91bd2852b1e281de39
msgid ""
"Vessels are equipped with a variety of RF equipment, typically including "
"radars and satcom devices. As they may interfere with the communications "
"between the VTA and the UAV, there are some general rules for finding a good"
" spot for installation on the vessel:"
msgstr ""
"船舶上装有各种射频设备，通常包括雷达和卫星通信设备。由于这些设备可能干扰 VTA 与无人机之间的通信，在船上选择合适安装位置时有以下通用原则："

#: ../../source/docs/common-alphaunmannedsystems-vcs.rst:90
#: 497ac59d32684e2997180d78c62e6f40 c791b973155f4608813c1fff7648d72e
#: caed0ab0196a47488b7df3ad7c9f5c8d
msgid ""
"VTA antennas or secondary radios must be as far as possible from the radar "
"and, if possible, in a different horizontal plane to avoid being under the "
"RF interference of the radar."
msgstr "VTA 天线或副无线电台必须尽可能远离雷达，并尽可能处于不同的水平面上，以避免受到雷达的射频干扰。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-alphaunmannedsystems-vcs.rst:91
#: 3faa0bd2f2614757a3f9097ddfef5f49 c24a1eb857e74ec89b879ac92f63491f
#: fc23c3ef5305489bbb0fbf48ae16b106
msgid ""
"The GNSS compass and IMU must have a clear view of the sky to correctly "
"receive the signal from GNSS satellites."
msgstr "GNSS 罗盘和 IMU 必须能无遮挡地看到天空，才能正确接收 GNSS 卫星信号。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-alphaunmannedsystems-vcs.rst:92
#: 09c1fa1bc03644699f0711cffd933541 1fe2d8ee83a04b279737a1616a45c2c0
#: 687cc15e23b54486b4df4ff6ea088b44
msgid ""
"If some area between the VTA and the UAV’s flight zone would be shadowed by "
"the vessel’s mast or any other vessel structure, this can be solved by "
"installing the 900MHz antenna or secondary radio systems and antennas at a "
"different location. A schematic overview of potential locations can be found"
" below."
msgstr ""
"如果 VTA 与无人机飞行区域之间的某些区域会被船桅或其他船体结构遮挡，可以将 900MHz "
"天线或副无线电系统及其天线安装在其他位置来解决。下面是可选安装位置的示意图。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-alphaunmannedsystems-vcs.rst:99
#: 0300ba8092e1423c8cbec6fb3107ee12 6e64ca2fa37346e0b44458b50addc481
#: f29093171e2841cc99f35632d025721e
msgid ""
"BLUE circles represent potential spots for the installation of the main VTA."
msgstr "蓝色圆圈表示主 VTA 的可选安装位置。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-alphaunmannedsystems-vcs.rst:100
#: 0955545cf2c04d679b264de9687693d9 14c1e5332f67446a8357b3a32ed6fe56
#: d11748a19ed049b38eb9f9c06bb7fd3e
msgid ""
"RED circles represent the potential installation points of the 900 MHz "
"antennas, secondary radio or secondary VTA."
msgstr "红色圆圈表示 900 MHz 天线、副无线电台或副 VTA 的可选安装点。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-alphaunmannedsystems-vcs.rst:101
#: 753c6eeb895a47a5b8e43b0a0bda3e8d 7700e00029b444679485ee4a035bb1e3
#: b23a17ddcd0243c2b5f6c81d3b32196b
msgid "BLUE lines are ETH cables to be routed from one system to the other."
msgstr "蓝色线条为需要在各系统之间敷设的 ETH 线缆。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-alphaunmannedsystems-vcs.rst:104
#: ba97921f4a4d491c91df930450b0c827 c53bf4d376c244a18487a5fa7f08dc23
#: c9b977824fbe4b02ae5ea8e39977bbfe
msgid "Integration steps"
msgstr "集成步骤"

#: ../../source/docs/common-alphaunmannedsystems-vcs.rst:106
#: 473ea621246e4fc1b0387596706daa06 6332a55f9abb4f1bac8681a3d600db00
#: d477835095f74709a46fe210bee12c91
msgid ""
"**Antenna location definition:** based on line of sight and RF compatibility"
" with other systems."
msgstr "**天线位置确定：** 根据视距以及与其他系统的射频兼容性确定。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-alphaunmannedsystems-vcs.rst:107
#: 32d436f894e5413aa17e1ca41858d0d2 759dd116693c4ba48e14f9860045bb6d
#: 9171f073187742648bc8b4a948cdf138
msgid ""
"**Operators location definition:** the permanent location for the operator "
"must be defined taking into consideration that EP will require visual access"
" to the UAV during take-off and landing. Operators room must be able to "
"accommodate 2 operators with 2 laptops and it is desirable to have extra "
"screens."
msgstr ""
"**操作员位置确定：** 必须确定操作员的固定位置，并考虑到外部飞行员（EP）在起飞和降落期间需要目视无人机。操作员室必须能容纳 2 名操作员和 2 "
"台笔记本电脑，最好还配有额外的显示器。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-alphaunmannedsystems-vcs.rst:108
#: 2318861f56b445edbaa1140a34231b39 60f71260192c4a28aa4617f39968107a
#: b62d77768e3743718f0bcd32ad6fed48
msgid ""
"**Antenna Interface definition:** interface between antenna and vessel is "
"defined. Normally it will be a mast with a plate on top matching the holes "
"pattern of the base of the VCS antennas."
msgstr "**天线接口确定：** 确定天线与船体之间的接口。通常为一根桅杆，顶部装有与 VCS 天线底座孔位相匹配的安装板。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-alphaunmannedsystems-vcs.rst:109
#: 3dbb07ab2fc441629eda6bbaaf8b6f66 7883b8cf6c1143a7bc2b533daa222a2e
#: fd2c3c40b34b4adbaa087e65602b2901
msgid ""
"**Distances:** lengths between all the components (antenna, center of heli-"
"deck and operators room) must be defined. These lengths will be used to "
"define reference offsets and to manufacture the cables with the appropriate "
"measure."
msgstr "**距离：** 必须确定所有部件（天线、直升机甲板中心和操作员室）之间的长度。这些长度将用于确定参考偏移量，并按合适的尺寸制作线缆。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-alphaunmannedsystems-vcs.rst:112
#: 85447b39291a4e6fac590222ea145e94 96398f81be2f40109a6072ed4e449901
#: b6e33d7b83a849dcbfe6030702c40794
msgid "Vessel Based Tracking Antenna Requirements"
msgstr "船载跟踪天线要求"

#: ../../source/docs/common-alphaunmannedsystems-vcs.rst:114
#: c38cf350a85d4993991418b340a7b6c7 eac3d77732bd43b49136fd6b03fbd379
#: f9dc43a292af434eab25bc2a25d79c90
msgid ""
"The tracking antenna has the following requirements that must be taken into "
"consideration:"
msgstr "跟踪天线有以下要求，必须予以考虑："

#: ../../source/docs/common-alphaunmannedsystems-vcs.rst:116
#: 050b58917d16432db882e339b89a0ce2 aff0f27a9d5545989a178f4c9ce802e1
#: c96cd4d0aa04487eb7fb6e088318b3c2
msgid ""
"**Power supply:** the antenna utilizes 220 V AC power supply; it can include"
" a 24V DC backup power source but normally on a vessel the AC power source "
"would be integrated with a UPS system. From the control room, the power "
"supply of the VTA must be able be switched on and off by means of a switch "
"as the ON/OFF button of the system will not be accessible."
msgstr ""
"**电源：** 天线使用 220 V 交流供电；可配备 24V 直流备用电源，但在船上通常会将交流电源接入 UPS 系统。由于系统的 ON/OFF "
