#: ../../source/docs/common-alphaunmannedsystems-vcs.rst:221
#: 0a48332898b541dca4cedd385fc08b82 913dc609bc3d4f119b9761af7a9f4661
#: f92f0381107b438b93c297065ade928d
msgid ""
"The **VCS** will receive information from both links and transmit it over "
"**Ethernet** via port **1976**. Connect the **PC**, acting as the ground "
"station, to the VCS and open Mission Planner. Then, connect to **UDP port "
"1976**."
msgstr ""
"**VCS** 会接收来自两条链路的信息，并通过 **Ethernet** 的 **1976** 端口发送。将充当地面站的 **PC** 连接到 "
"VCS，打开 Mission Planner，然后连接 **UDP 端口 1976**。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-alphaunmannedsystems-vcs.rst:229
#: 07c5f0b614c7448cb2d5d2efdacf1f4f 34009eda912a4334922a6aa440bc3f11
#: 6446dbe76b0c4032ae36edb907d615b9
msgid ""
"If all the radios are linked and configured, Mission Planner should receive "
"**autopilot configuration data**. Additionally, the system provides a "
"**Mission Planner plugin** to monitor the real-time status of the VCS, "
"links, GNSS, and user commands such as **link switching**, **storage mode**,"
" **reset**, and **static position tracking**."
msgstr ""
"若所有电台均已连接并配置完成，Mission Planner 应能收到 **飞控配置数据**。此外，系统还提供一个 **Mission Planner "
"插件**，用于监控 VCS、链路、GNSS 的实时状态，以及 **链路切换**、**存储模式**、**复位**、**静态位置跟踪** 等用户命令。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-alphaunmannedsystems-vcs.rst:238
#: 3ff9b8514e5a4e4ab5ea842d798940da 8e85d0e208bd4b2fa8d46f7f1cc786d1
#: 9f1ec2ce8fe442f8803c28418a1a59fb
msgid ""
"Both VCS configuration terminal and plugin must not be active at the same "
"time due to connection interferences to internal ports."
msgstr "由于会对内部端口连接造成干扰，VCS 配置终端与插件不得同时处于活动状态。"

